1
00:00:04,496 --> 00:00:06,336
[CHATTERING ON TV]

2
00:00:08,626 --> 00:00:11,546
(Leonard:)Did I miss anything?
Did they kick Giselle off?

3
00:00:11,962 --> 00:00:16,052
(Raj:)Not yet, but her underwater photo shoot
was an embarrassment.

4
00:00:16,258 --> 00:00:20,808
(Howard:)Sadly, Mrs. Giselle Wolowitz
is sensitive to chlorine.

5
00:00:21,472 --> 00:00:26,022
(Howard:)Lucky for her I like my fashion models
pruny and bug-eyed.

6
00:00:26,602 --> 00:00:27,982
(Leonard:)Sheldon, the food's here.

7
00:00:28,145 --> 00:00:29,185
Oh, there's the house.

8
00:00:29,355 --> 00:00:31,605
(Raj:)Freeze frame, freeze frame.

9
00:00:37,279 --> 00:00:40,159
- What are you doing?
- Marking the positions and landmarks...

10
00:00:40,324 --> 00:00:43,414
(Raj:)...so we can find the house
of the supermodels.

11
00:00:44,703 --> 00:00:46,493
(Leonard:)- Why?
- Isn't it obvious?

12
00:00:46,664 --> 00:00:48,664
(Howard:)Every week they kick out
a beautiful girl...

13
00:00:48,832 --> 00:00:52,172
(Howard:)...making her feel unwanted
and without self-esteem.

14
00:00:53,837 --> 00:00:56,967
(Howard:)A.k.a. the future Mrs. Howard Wolowitz.

15
00:00:58,133 --> 00:00:59,843
- Is my hamburger medium-well?
- Yes.

16
00:01:00,010 --> 00:01:01,340
- Dill slices, not sweet?
- Yes.

